diagram pipeline "CI/CD Deployment Pipeline"
viewport 100x26
direction right
theme midnight

group ci "Build & Test" kind parallel at 2,3 size 40x16
node build "Compile" kind activity in ci at 5,6 size 12x3
node test "Unit Tests" kind activity in ci at 22,6 size 14x3
edge e1 build -> test

group cd "Deployment" kind repeat at 46,3 size 48x16
node staging "Staging Deploy" kind agent in cd at 49,6 size 16x3
decision verify "Healthy?" in cd at 70,6 size 9x3
node prod "Production" kind success at 80,14 size 14x3

edge e2 test -> staging
edge e3 staging -> verify
edge e4 verify -> prod kind success label "YES"
edge e5 verify -> staging kind back label "RETRY"

align horizontal build test staging verify
